      {
        "body": "A **loot group** is one data file naming a category of vanilla loot tables and a tag of\npieces found in them, one per theme. Armor skins are divided over the same groups, and a\nfitting template turns up in every one of them. A pack adds a whole look to the world with\none group, or drops one piece into one chest from the piece's own data file, which is the one\nthing a datapack could not do for itself, since it can only replace a vanilla table whole.\n",
        "id": "groups",
        "title": "Loot groups"
      },
