        "layout": "table",
        "title": "The groups that ship"
      },
      {
        "after": "shipped-groups",
        "body": "One pool per table, rolled once. A chest's odds of holding something of the mod's stay put\nhowever many pieces are added: another piece changes *which* one you find, never how often. A\nloot function can also put a piece on a piece of armor a table drops, gem and all.\n",
        "id": "chance",
        "title": "The chance belongs to the table"
      },
      {
        "after": "chance",
        "body": "A minority of pieces have a template recipe, where the centre item is plainly the piece or\nwhat it is made of. The rest are found only. A server can turn any recipe off by\n[overriding it](/wiki/getting-started/#switching-a-recipe-off).\n",
        "id": "crafting",
        "title": "Crafting"
      },
