    "name": "Finding pieces",
    "root": "../..",
    "sections": {
      "about": "Most pieces are found rather than made. Each theme turns up in the structures that suit it:\nknightly gear in strongholds and trial chambers, beast trophies in bastions, court jewellery in\nmansions and ancient cities, tidal pieces in shipwrecks and ocean ruins, wayfarer gear on the\nroad, carapace in the deep.\n",
